text = "Lasergun is a long-range firearm, completely ineffective up close, but deadly when used on distant targets.

Since it fires concentrated photons (gamma radiation), it only deals long-term cellular damage, meaning it causes no harm for the next several hours. However, the photons defocus due to air, and the laser strikes a larger area at a lower velocity, causing instant burns. The greater distance, the higher damage dealt to the subject. Laser also deals delayed damage due to ignition caused by the temperature.

Attached to it is a laser stunner, which creates a chain of lightning between targets, disabling them and dealing stamina damage. Lightning may also strike the owner if they are close enough to it. It's most effective to stun a group of enemies, create distance, and fire using the primary mode."
